+++ b/Help/release/dev/cpack-archive-uname.rst	2026-11-10 04:02:39.355786238 -0600
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+cpack-archive-uname
+-------------------
+
+* The :cpack_gen:`CPack Archive Generator` gained
+  :variable:`CPACK_ARCHIVE_UNAME` and :variable:`CPACK_ARCHIVE_GNAME` to set the
+  user and group names of archive entries, which until now always named the
+  user running CPack, and :variable:`CPACK_ARCHIVE_SORT_ENTRIES` to write
+  entries in name order rather than the filesystem's readdir order.
